    "body": "In Asian markets, the dollar held steady as traders looked ahead to crucial inflation reports, particularly the US PCE data set to be released before the Jackson Hole symposium this weekend. Meanwhile, oil prices dipped due to easing tensions in the Middle East and halted diplomatic negotiations. The Australian dollar strengthened following favorable inflation figures, while cryptocurrencies continued their upward trajectory, and gold saw a minor decline.",
