    "headline": "Before Xi Jinping's likely India visit, Chinese money is pouring in",
    "body": "India is cautiously reopening economic channels with China as Chinese linked investment returns after years of restrictions following the Galwan clash. More than $500 million has entered under revised investment rules, while NSA Ajit Doval’s Beijing visit and Xi Jinping’s expected India visit signal improving diplomatic ties. India is balancing economic cooperation with national security safeguards and strategic scrutiny.",
